{
  "name": "Turn RSS items into reviewed drafts with an LLM and an approval step",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "10d7215a-b542-5305-9cbc-137097dec89f",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn RSS items into reviewed drafts\n\nEvery morning the workflow reads a feed, keeps only items it has not seen before (at most 3 a day), and drafts a short post for each. Each draft waits for a person to approve, edit or skip it, one at a time, before it is saved.\n\n**Setup**\n1. *Read feed*: your RSS or Atom URL.\n2. *Chat model*: an **OpenAI** credential; for another OpenAI-compatible provider set its **Base URL** (ending in `/v1`) and the model id it serves.\n3. Replace *Notify reviewer* with Slack or email and send `{{ $execution.resumeFormUrl }}`.\n4. Replace *Save draft* with your CMS, Notion or Google Docs node.\n\nThe first run treats every current item as new; *Only new items* remembers links from then on. More than 3 new items in a day: the extra ones are skipped, not queued (feeds list newest first, so the newest 3 are kept). Raise *At most 3 a day* for a busy feed.\n\nOptional: [using this with Kunavo](https://kunavo.com/docs/integrations/n8n?utm_source=n8n-templates&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=i06-rss-drafts).",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 540
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ec227e35-4a15-57dd-b4d0-e71bce113db2",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "95c4c75d-85db-5d2f-b350-180221847a88",
      "name": "Read feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://blog.n8n.io/rss/",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "998b3d4f-f4df-5140-9876-26e52cc97fe8",
      "name": "Only new items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.link }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5459c74-f0b0-59ad-9bd5-c93ae776b891",
      "name": "At most 3 a day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "88d3f5f4-02e3-5a48-8e53-21dd47e506d3",
      "name": "Loop over items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "62b89209-9a91-5866-874b-9115cbb13a84",
      "name": "Draft post",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1100,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Title: {{ $json.title }}\nLink: {{ $json.link }}\nSummary: {{ ($json.contentSnippet || $json.content || '').slice(0, 1500) }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "type": "SystemMessagePromptTemplate",
              "message": "You write short posts for a team's internal newsletter from articles in an RSS feed.\nFor the article given, write 60-100 words: what it is about and why it may matter to the reader.\nPlain language, no hype, no emojis, no hashtags. Do not claim anything the title and summary do not say.\nEnd with the link on its own line."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "77bf39f4-8604-55f7-a325-eb28241b6e11",
      "name": "Chat model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1100,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7d86fc3d-9797-56e1-97f3-5a00c12dcd25",
      "name": "Notify reviewer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "47aa2c47-172a-587f-b1fc-be4b02914215",
      "name": "Approve draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1540,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "form",
        "formTitle": "Approve this draft",
        "formDescription": "={{ $('Loop over items').first().json.title }}\n\n{{ $('Draft post').first().json.text }}",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Decision",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Approve"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Skip"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Edited text",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "Leave empty to keep the draft"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "1f71b074-030d-5dfb-b42d-3ee6018a3168"
    },
    {
      "id": "30a2e50c-ab13-5a73-a29e-6c065867705a",
      "name": "Approved?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d452f8cc-ed77-53b9-83e7-98c554023485",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Decision }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "rightValue": "Approve"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b9f5612c-0578-57d9-b9c5-6c9d60a7064e",
      "name": "Prepare draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// What gets saved: the reviewer's edit if there is one, the draft otherwise.\nconst review = $input.first().json;\nconst item = $('Loop over items').first().json;\nconst draft = $('Draft post').first().json.text;\nconst edited = String(review['Edited text'] ?? '').trim();\nreturn [{ json: { title: item.title, link: item.link, text: edited || draft, editedByReviewer: edited.length > 0 } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5880ea28-50b9-5977-9a2a-e48c51371738",
      "name": "Save draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "ede7de16-9315-5f68-ab4f-6d69cbdde73d",
      "name": "Skipped",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1980,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ],
